WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 24]

02:25.320 --> 02:26.580
If I may comment,

02:27.240 --> 02:28.620
I've fought those four

02:28.920 --> 02:30.090
Foundation Establishment Blood Guards before.

02:30.560 --> 02:31.730
They are strong.

02:32.390 --> 02:33.980
Especially their Demonic Transformation.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.820
It allows them to ascend

02:36.240 --> 02:37.410
to the next tier by brute force.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.450
Of course,

02:39.640 --> 02:40.850
it is not without weaknesses.

02:41.760 --> 02:42.660
One, the transformation

02:42.920 --> 02:43.980
requires one to enter a Blood Cocoon.

02:44.280 --> 02:45.260
That takes time.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.050
Two, upon transformation,

02:47.350 --> 02:48.410
one will be overtaken by the thirst for blood

02:48.710 --> 02:49.620
and lose all

02:49.790 --> 02:50.740
rationality.

02:51.920 --> 02:53.180
We can exploit those two weaknesses.

02:53.840 --> 02:54.660
Do not forget that.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.620
We'll try to waste their time.

02:58.480 --> 02:59.490
My fellow sisters,

02:59.760 --> 03:01.260
please stick to our plan.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.180
If things go awry,

03:03.510 --> 03:04.180
quit fighting

03:04.560 --> 03:06.020
and regroup with us immediately.

03:07.220 --> 03:08.860
[Cold Palace]

03:23.000 --> 03:24.900
Stay alert.

03:25.590 --> 03:26.850
Master is training in solitude.

03:27.150 --> 03:28.900
We have released Beguiling Mist in the palace.

03:29.870 --> 03:32.900
So don't fall into a deep slumber

03:35.040 --> 03:36.130
like those mortals did.

03:40.480 --> 03:41.930
Those three scoundrels.

03:42.400 --> 03:45.060
Who do they think they are?

03:46.080 --> 03:47.890
How dare they put me on watch duty?

03:49.430 --> 03:51.450
The enemies will fall for our traps, they said.

03:53.800 --> 03:54.940
It's just an excuse to shirk.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.450
Once Master comes out,

04:01.080 --> 04:02.220
I'll report them to him.

04:37.680 --> 04:39.130
What is this new gadget?

04:39.150 --> 04:40.010
It's quite useful.

04:40.520 --> 04:41.730
I assembled it myself.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.380
It's more than enough to fight

04:43.870 --> 04:44.780
weaker cultivators.

04:48.190 --> 04:48.940
I knew it. An ambush.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.610
Kill the messengers first.

04:50.870 --> 04:51.570
Don't alert others.

05:38.800 --> 05:39.690
How annoying.

05:40.030 --> 05:40.660
Alert others.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.220
Yes!

06:37.600 --> 06:38.540
We have made ourselves known.

06:39.040 --> 06:39.780
There's no use hiding.

06:40.920 --> 06:41.850
Chen Rong, Chen Mu,

06:42.190 --> 06:43.700
please deal with those rookie cultivators.

06:44.070 --> 06:44.810
My Seniors in arms,

06:45.000 --> 06:45.700
let's give chase

06:46.040 --> 06:46.900
and kill this demon.

06:47.160 --> 06:47.730
Sure.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.100
A long fight is risky.

08:22.430 --> 08:23.050
Make it quick.

09:10.750 --> 09:11.700
You three idiots!

09:11.800 --> 09:13.290
Come out already!

09:50.560 --> 09:51.930
Qingwen, Tie Luo,

09:52.190 --> 09:53.610
you ingrates!

09:54.120 --> 09:56.610
I won't spare you even when I'm dead!

10:32.790 --> 10:33.730
How fun.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.180
That beast is mine.

10:35.750 --> 10:36.820
Don't get in my way.

10:44.960 --> 10:45.940
I'm talking to you.

10:55.320 --> 10:56.530
Go transform now.

10:58.000 --> 10:59.130
I'll deal with them.

11:21.550 --> 11:22.100
He's too strong.

11:22.120 --> 11:22.760
I can't defeat him.

11:22.880 --> 11:23.850
Let's swap.

11:24.200 --> 11:24.700
Come.

11:38.320 --> 11:39.650
Today, I shall avenge

11:39.960 --> 11:41.180
my lost arm.

12:03.510 --> 12:04.180
I can handle this.

12:04.720 --> 12:05.730
Stop him from transforming.

12:06.440 --> 12:07.010
All right.

12:46.670 --> 12:47.300
Meng,

12:47.480 --> 12:48.130
watch out!

13:08.910 --> 13:09.580
Bladestorm?

13:10.750 --> 13:11.530
As expected of you, Jing.

13:13.030 --> 13:13.770
Let me aid you.

14:26.320 --> 14:27.250
Regenerate if you want.

14:28.030 --> 14:29.010
I'll just chop it off again.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.100
Good.

14:34.790 --> 14:35.530
Rage on.

14:36.550 --> 14:38.130
The transformation brings out your animalistic instincts.

14:38.670 --> 14:40.130
If he loses his humanity,

14:40.550 --> 14:41.610
he'll be dead soon.

14:42.750 --> 14:43.730
Where are the two other Blood Guards?

14:47.240 --> 14:47.700
Watch out!

14:55.960 --> 14:56.580
Senior Song.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.980
Take care of the meathead.

14:58.360 --> 14:58.940
Sure.

14:59.510 --> 15:00.010
Chen Rong.

15:02.030 --> 15:02.420
This is bad.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.420
It is a very potent corpse venom.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.130
Here.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.820
I can't believe we met again.

15:20.120 --> 15:21.100
How have you been,

15:21.840 --> 15:22.850
Han?

15:26.510 --> 15:28.610
I see you used the Ascension Token to enroll in Yellow Maple Valley.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.650
And you have reached mid-Foundation Establishment.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.460
You

15:33.390 --> 15:35.130
lured rogue cultivators to join you at Tainan Bazaar.

15:35.860 --> 15:36.890
Thanks to you,

15:37.320 --> 15:39.090
Wu Jiuzhi has turned to this.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.750
Fate keeps me alive

15:44.030 --> 15:45.580
so that I can kill you.

15:46.360 --> 15:47.130
Enough.

15:47.550 --> 15:48.770
For what you did to Wan Xiaoshan,

15:49.150 --> 15:50.650
we'll settle the score today.

16:08.000 --> 16:08.730
Go support Senior Liu.

16:10.150 --> 16:10.770
Take care.

16:51.750 --> 16:52.730
Like I said,

16:53.030 --> 16:54.100
you are mine.

16:54.510 --> 16:56.730
You're different from others.

16:57.290 --> 16:58.850
You fight like a martial artist.

17:02.600 --> 17:03.730
You are smart.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.890
I hail from the Song Clan of Hanzhou.

17:06.440 --> 17:07.820
We are a martial arts clan.

17:08.870 --> 17:09.980
Perhaps you

17:10.270 --> 17:11.340
were also

17:11.630 --> 17:12.580
a martial artist?

17:16.240 --> 17:18.420
Cultivators like you claim to stay away from the mortal affairs.

17:18.790 --> 17:20.530
Yet the endless war in our world

17:21.030 --> 17:23.420
is all orchestrated by the cultivation sects.

17:24.550 --> 17:27.100
You claim to maintain peace.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.980
But in the end,

17:29.200 --> 17:30.460
the mortals pay with their lives.

17:31.150 --> 17:32.610
You're neither a human nor a demon.

17:33.030 --> 17:34.060
You don't have the right

17:34.480 --> 17:35.460
to speak such insolent words

17:35.870 --> 17:36.850
on behalf of all mortals.

17:37.360 --> 17:38.650
Scums from the Seven Sects,

17:39.200 --> 17:40.460
die!

18:32.120 --> 18:32.770
The art of spear

18:33.200 --> 18:33.580
is about

18:33.790 --> 18:34.250
blocking,

18:34.480 --> 18:34.940
lifting,

18:35.320 --> 18:35.770
stabbing,

18:36.320 --> 18:36.770
parrying,

18:36.960 --> 18:37.490
striking,

18:37.720 --> 18:38.220
sweeping,

18:40.350 --> 18:41.050
and thrusting.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.620
The same goes for the art of sword.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.290
The longer the weapon,

18:44.440 --> 18:45.140
the stronger it is.

18:45.720 --> 18:47.010
Your reckless fighting technique

18:47.270 --> 18:48.570
does no justice to your monstrous strength.

18:48.830 --> 18:50.380
What a waste.

18:51.400 --> 18:53.250
You talk so much.

19:04.160 --> 19:04.730
We did it.

19:07.270 --> 19:08.330
Careful!

19:14.240 --> 19:14.900
Chen Mu!

19:20.790 --> 19:21.330
Chen Mu.

19:21.960 --> 19:22.530
Chen Mu.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.530
I'm sorry.

19:42.400 --> 19:43.420
You

19:43.680 --> 19:45.530
must taste good too.

20:02.240 --> 20:02.860
Chen Mu.

20:05.550 --> 20:06.010
Chen Mu.

20:06.960 --> 20:07.420
Chen Mu.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.010
Chen Mu.

20:39.880 --> 20:40.980
One less useless ally

20:41.440 --> 20:42.330
for you.

20:42.720 --> 20:43.330
Han,

20:43.640 --> 20:44.380
make it quick.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.380
I need your support.

21:08.790 --> 21:10.050
This is Pinggu's belonging.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.620
Drop dead.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.490
I will crush you

21:30.030 --> 21:32.700
with my bare hands!

22:00.510 --> 22:02.140
Using his blood essence to activate his life-bound treasure?

22:02.750 --> 22:04.180
Senior Liu is going all out.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.290
You are quite durable.

22:13.960 --> 22:14.530
Tell me.

22:14.880 --> 22:15.810
What is your name?

22:16.240 --> 22:17.570
If I'm in a good mood, I'll erect

22:17.830 --> 22:18.490
a tombstone for you.

22:18.640 --> 22:20.570
I am Tie Luo, General of Lanzhou Cavalry.

22:20.830 --> 22:21.770
I'll also be the man who takes your life.

23:22.960 --> 23:23.900
Stop hiding any tricks.

23:26.960 --> 23:27.900
Our foe is strong.

23:28.440 --> 23:29.330
The ice demon is dead.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.050
Transform now

23:31.310 --> 23:32.380
and fight them

23:33.000 --> 23:35.290
with me!

23:37.500 --> 23:38.380
♪Chasing wind♪

23:38.700 --> 23:40.780
♪I set out afar♪

23:40.980 --> 23:42.620
♪The road ahead lost♪

23:43.020 --> 23:44.260
♪My voice unheard♪

23:44.620 --> 23:46.340
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

23:46.540 --> 23:47.380
♪Laying low♪

23:47.620 --> 23:49.540
♪I plan every move...♪

23:49.960 --> 23:51.010
What a hassle.

23:51.980 --> 23:53.260
♪And lingering ties♪

23:53.660 --> 23:55.420
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

23:55.820 --> 23:59.020
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

23:59.420 --> 24:02.540
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

24:04.020 --> 24:07.140
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

24:08.340 --> 24:12.700
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

24:16.140 --> 24:18.020
♪Don't mock my ordinary life...♪

24:18.880 --> 24:19.980
Thank you, my fellow juniors.

24:20.310 --> 24:21.090
You may back down.

24:25.140 --> 24:27.020
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

24:27.260 --> 24:28.740
♪Kind at heart♪

24:29.060 --> 24:30.540
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

24:30.780 --> 24:32.660
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

24:33.060 --> 24:34.820
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

24:35.220 --> 24:37.140
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

24:37.420 --> 24:39.300
♪And I return with a heart refined...♪

24:42.640 --> 24:44.380
You evil beings.

24:44.790 --> 24:46.180
Be cleansed!

24:47.340 --> 24:50.580
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

24:53.900 --> 24:57.380
♪Drunken steps, high song over ocean and mountaintop♪

24:58.460 --> 25:01.860
♪The celestial gourd bears dew, the Golden Core takes shape♪

25:02.620 --> 25:06.540
♪Deep in the night, the crane soars through autumn's clear sky♪

25:07.460 --> 25:09.340
♪Across endless western winds cuts a lone sword, cold and true♪

25:10.220 --> 25:13.140
♪A lone sword, cold and true♪

25:14.900 --> 25:16.620
♪Don't mock my ordinary life...♪

25:17.480 --> 25:18.330
No. Wait.

25:18.440 --> 25:19.250
I'm almost done.

25:19.400 --> 25:20.900
I'm almost done!

25:23.580 --> 25:25.500
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

25:25.780 --> 25:27.180
♪Kind at heart♪

25:27.460 --> 25:29.020
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

25:29.220 --> 25:31.140
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

25:31.420 --> 25:33.300
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

25:33.740 --> 25:35.620
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

25:35.820 --> 25:37.780
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

25:41.620 --> 25:43.180
♪Forged by trial♪

25:43.540 --> 25:45.340
♪I rise through three realms♪

25:45.780 --> 25:49.140
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

26:02.640 --> 26:03.770
They lost?

26:06.640 --> 26:07.380
Good.

26:07.830 --> 26:09.660
I don't have to intervene then.

26:15.750 --> 26:16.660
Villain.

26:17.310 --> 26:18.380
You cannot leave.

26:23.110 --> 26:24.660
What joy is there in life?

26:24.880 --> 26:26.380
What suffering is there in death?

26:27.070 --> 26:28.660
You cannot leave...

26:40.720 --> 26:42.420
It defeated a mid-Foundation Establishment

26:42.750 --> 26:43.810
demon in one blow.

26:44.350 --> 26:45.460
As expected of a life-bound treasure.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.290
However,

26:46.750 --> 26:48.180
it also burned the mystic pouch to a crisp.

26:48.830 --> 26:49.570
What a waste.

26:51.240 --> 26:51.940
Han.

26:52.680 --> 26:53.220
I consider

26:53.480 --> 26:54.090
this match

26:54.240 --> 26:54.900
a draw.

27:08.240 --> 27:08.980
Well done, Jing!

27:11.200 --> 27:11.860
We've killed them all.

27:14.310 --> 27:15.290
You would sacrifice

27:15.790 --> 27:16.860
your life-bound treasure to kill demons.

27:17.750 --> 27:18.330
How admirable.

27:20.640 --> 27:21.570
You flatter me, Han.

27:22.550 --> 27:23.570
Don't

27:23.750 --> 27:24.900
tell Weiniang about today.

27:28.270 --> 27:29.180
I don't want her to worry.

27:32.110 --> 27:32.570
Chen Mu.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.660
I didn't mean to kill you.

27:36.510 --> 27:38.010
How am I supposed to face others now?

27:53.510 --> 27:54.570
What am I supposed to do now?

27:57.750 --> 27:58.620
Their leader still lives.

27:59.160 --> 28:00.050
No one knows

28:00.350 --> 28:02.050
if the worst will come.

28:02.880 --> 28:03.980
We can't leave him here.

28:22.160 --> 28:22.570
Chen Mu.

28:23.270 --> 28:23.940
Forgive me.

28:30.920 --> 28:31.530
Forgive me.

28:31.720 --> 28:32.530
Chen Mu.

28:41.960 --> 28:42.570
Senior Liu.

28:43.270 --> 28:43.940
Senior Song.

28:44.590 --> 28:45.330
Senior Han.

28:46.110 --> 28:47.050
I'll tell

28:47.550 --> 28:49.220
Qiaoqian about Chen Mu myself.

28:49.880 --> 28:51.290
Don't tell her for now.

28:52.000 --> 28:52.900
I don't want her to be distraught.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.660
Of course.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.140
My condolences.

29:12.960 --> 29:13.420
Chen Mu,

29:14.200 --> 29:15.050
let's go home.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.010
Let's go inside.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.810
Something is amiss.

30:27.720 --> 30:29.250
This might be their hideout.

30:31.880 --> 30:32.220
Over here.

31:02.350 --> 31:03.290
Murong Qing.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.490
Zheng Tiannan.

31:04.510 --> 31:05.180
Zhou Yan.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.530
Chu Shanming.

31:08.200 --> 31:08.940
Zhang Wei.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.140
Feng Wan'er.

31:10.240 --> 31:10.900
An Keqiao.

31:10.920 --> 31:11.860
Zhang Shuisheng.

31:12.920 --> 31:13.700
Murong Chu.

31:13.960 --> 31:14.940
These should be

31:16.240 --> 31:17.380
the names of the victims.

31:17.880 --> 31:18.530
Meng Yuan.

31:18.960 --> 31:19.770
Murong Zhu.

31:21.400 --> 31:22.490
Shen Qianxun.

31:25.350 --> 31:26.180
A blood pool?

31:39.400 --> 31:40.140
Jing.

31:42.030 --> 31:42.570
Jing.

31:43.510 --> 31:44.090
Are you all right?

31:45.510 --> 31:46.290
Did you

31:46.400 --> 31:47.090
have a flashback?

31:48.640 --> 31:50.490
We can kill all dark cultivators and demonic sects.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.810
There will always be new ones.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.180
They can't be purged.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.460
You

31:58.110 --> 31:59.730
are too critical of yourself.

32:01.000 --> 32:02.860
It's all in the past.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.570
We're no longer the trembling kids

32:04.920 --> 32:06.700
in the dungeon.

32:08.830 --> 32:09.700
We gained spirit roots

32:10.240 --> 32:11.420
and became Foundation Establishment cultivators.

32:14.270 --> 32:15.460
It's been so many years.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.730
You are still my senior.

32:18.830 --> 32:19.530
I'm still not as capable as you.

32:23.030 --> 32:24.420
Your potential

32:25.000 --> 32:26.050
is far superior to mine.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.770
But you've been suppressing yourself.

32:29.110 --> 32:30.460
You ascend every time after I do

32:31.830 --> 32:33.980
so that I don't feel inferior.

32:34.750 --> 32:35.180
Right?

32:36.960 --> 32:37.940
Just because you don't

32:38.000 --> 32:39.330
say it out doesn't mean I wouldn't know.

32:44.920 --> 32:46.090
Come on. That's not true.

32:47.000 --> 32:48.180
When it comes to cultivation,

32:48.510 --> 32:49.700
there's no waiting for anyone else.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.090
Also,

32:52.680 --> 32:53.860
I'm not as thoughtful as you imagine.

32:55.510 --> 32:57.010
No need to comfort me.

32:58.200 --> 33:00.180
The experiment those dark cultivators put me through

33:00.920 --> 33:01.700
has damaged my constitution.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.980
I might never reach the Core Formation Stage ever.

33:11.440 --> 33:13.770
Weiniang and you have great potential.

33:14.550 --> 33:16.380
Don't squander your talent away.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.050
You

33:23.200 --> 33:24.660
always make things up.

33:25.550 --> 33:26.220
This is not fun.

33:27.750 --> 33:28.460
I'll check on Han.

33:29.030 --> 33:30.380
Thank you so much for what you've done, Song Meng.

33:55.310 --> 33:55.940
What is going on?

33:56.510 --> 33:57.090
There is no exit.

34:47.640 --> 34:48.220
Jing!

34:49.000 --> 34:49.380
Weiniang.

34:49.400 --> 34:49.940
- Weiniang? - Qiaoqian.

34:52.720 --> 34:53.730
How did you find this place?

34:54.640 --> 34:55.530
We chanced upon

34:55.640 --> 34:56.490
a contraption.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.250
Then, we ran into the emperor

34:59.000 --> 35:00.090
and took the secret passage here.

35:00.960 --> 35:01.570
The Black Fiend Cult

35:01.750 --> 35:03.420
sure has done many things.

35:03.710 --> 35:04.620
[Emperor Yue]
It digs deep.

35:07.000 --> 35:07.730
Greetings,

35:08.160 --> 35:09.770
fellow cultivators.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.220
Thank you for rescuing me.

35:11.590 --> 35:12.460
You're welcome.

35:13.070 --> 35:14.980
It is our duty to kill dark cultivators.

35:16.790 --> 35:18.460
There is a soporific array here.

35:19.160 --> 35:20.090
All mortals will fall asleep.

35:20.720 --> 35:22.010
How do you stay awake?

35:23.000 --> 35:23.810
And did you

35:24.270 --> 35:25.330
run into

35:25.510 --> 35:25.980
any pursuers?

35:27.550 --> 35:29.330
Master,

35:29.590 --> 35:30.220
I have

35:30.310 --> 35:31.660
no idea at all.

35:31.920 --> 35:32.700
I stumbled upon

35:32.920 --> 35:34.530
these two cultivators

35:34.720 --> 35:36.570
and they woke me up.

35:37.270 --> 35:38.980
They even gave me a pill.

35:39.350 --> 35:40.250
Master,

35:40.920 --> 35:41.860
are my

35:42.070 --> 35:43.010
consorts

35:43.350 --> 35:44.340
and ministers

35:45.550 --> 35:46.210
all...

35:46.670 --> 35:49.010
Are they all dead?

35:52.920 --> 35:53.530
Han,

35:53.960 --> 35:56.260
I did give him a sobering pill.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.570
And we truly

35:57.960 --> 35:59.010
did not run into pursuers here.

36:04.110 --> 36:04.820
Han,

36:05.590 --> 36:06.690
the enemies still roam about.

36:07.110 --> 36:08.570
Let's find more clues now.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.300
Any delay will bring more variables.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.780
Come with us.

36:12.400 --> 36:13.490
We can protect you.

36:15.030 --> 36:16.130
Thank you.

36:17.320 --> 36:17.940
Weiniang,

36:18.280 --> 36:19.420
please look after him

36:19.670 --> 36:20.570
with Qiaoqian.

36:20.920 --> 36:21.610
Don't worry about it, Jing.

36:22.280 --> 36:22.860
Let's go.

36:47.710 --> 36:48.130
Seniors.

36:50.670 --> 36:51.460
There might be traps.

37:09.400 --> 37:10.050
What is this place?

37:12.190 --> 37:13.300
What is this place?

37:14.110 --> 37:15.130
I've

37:15.360 --> 37:16.420
never been here either.

37:51.920 --> 37:55.170
Apologies for the lack of reception, my esteemed guests.

37:57.280 --> 37:58.610
But since you're here,

37:59.630 --> 38:01.210
there's no need to leave.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.900
Late Foundation Stage.

38:05.440 --> 38:07.010
He is the leader of Black Field Cult.

38:08.320 --> 38:09.340
Evil cultist.

39:15.630 --> 39:16.300
Chen Rong!

39:40.070 --> 39:41.210
Why did he attack

39:41.230 --> 39:42.690
the weakest Chen Rong first?

39:43.670 --> 39:46.130
Time to return them to their rightful owner.

39:47.030 --> 39:48.650
Are they the Blood Condensing Five-Element Pills?

39:49.230 --> 39:50.130
How come there are only four?

39:57.320 --> 39:58.300
You shall not leave!

40:02.510 --> 40:03.010
Come.

40:16.480 --> 40:17.460
Where did he go?

40:34.360 --> 40:36.050
He is a Late Foundation Stage cultivator.

40:36.920 --> 40:38.690
Why did he attack ruthlessly

40:39.590 --> 40:41.490
as if he doesn't care about his life?

40:42.670 --> 40:43.420
Unless

40:44.280 --> 40:45.900
there's something wrong with the Blood Condensing Five-Element Pills?

40:53.800 --> 40:54.980
Thank you.

40:55.960 --> 40:57.340
You brought me

40:57.630 --> 40:59.300
the Blood Condensing Five-Element Pills.

40:59.960 --> 41:00.980
Everything

41:01.320 --> 41:02.940
is now in order.

41:06.510 --> 41:06.980
One.

41:07.230 --> 41:07.740
Two.

41:08.110 --> 41:08.570
Three.

41:08.840 --> 41:09.340
Four.

41:09.760 --> 41:11.420
Who is the last Blood Condensing Five-Element Pill?

41:11.800 --> 41:12.650
Tie Luo is metal.

41:13.360 --> 41:14.210
Qingwen is wood.

41:14.920 --> 41:16.380
The ice demon is water.

41:16.960 --> 41:17.900
Wu Jiuzhi is earth.

41:18.280 --> 41:19.780
He must be fire then.

41:20.670 --> 41:21.130
Oh, no.

41:21.920 --> 41:23.210
He is not the leader of the Black Fiend Cult,

41:23.960 --> 41:25.010
but the last Blood Guard.

41:25.230 --> 41:26.570
Where is

41:27.710 --> 41:28.420
the real leader then?

41:49.760 --> 41:50.340
Jing!

41:50.510 --> 41:50.860
Jing!

41:50.880 --> 41:51.380
Weiniang.

41:56.960 --> 41:57.940
- Do not move. - Weiniang.

41:58.590 --> 42:00.130
Or he will die.

42:02.510 --> 42:03.130
Jing.

42:04.150 --> 42:05.210
I'm sorry.

42:05.920 --> 42:07.740
You have to show your face today.

42:08.400 --> 42:09.460
Don't worry, my dear brother.

42:10.320 --> 42:12.050
What's yours is mine.

42:15.230 --> 42:16.130
Villains,

42:16.510 --> 42:18.170
quit pretending.

42:18.800 --> 42:19.690
You sicken me!

42:20.110 --> 42:20.820
Jing.

42:21.070 --> 42:22.130
Stop speaking.

42:22.400 --> 42:23.610
Use your power to heal yourself now.

42:24.150 --> 42:25.380
You're right.

42:28.030 --> 42:28.650
He's

42:29.590 --> 42:31.380
about to die.

42:31.800 --> 42:34.260
Surrender yourself.

42:37.960 --> 42:38.490
Weiniang.

42:50.880 --> 42:51.900
Jing!

43:08.460 --> 43:13.780
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:15.020 --> 43:20.420
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:20.540 --> 43:23.740
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:23.980 --> 43:26.220
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:26.620 --> 43:29.460
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:29.980 --> 43:33.940
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:34.780 --> 43:40.260
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:41.420 --> 43:46.700
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:47.300 --> 43:50.340
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:50.620 --> 43:52.740
♪Swept away by time♪

43:53.380 --> 43:56.020
♪Eyes once looked far♪

43:56.500 --> 44:00.460
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.780
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:04.060 --> 44:05.980
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:06.420 --> 44:08.860
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:09.180 --> 44:12.700
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:13.260 --> 44:16.220
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:16.540 --> 44:19.460
♪Time lost its name♪

44:19.860 --> 44:22.700
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:23.100 --> 44:26.660
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:27.020 --> 44:29.860
♪The world has changed♪

44:30.260 --> 44:32.100
♪Beyond recall♪

44:32.660 --> 44:34.380
♪Time will fade♪

44:34.780 --> 44:39.580
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:40.260 --> 44:43.140
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:43.620 --> 44:48.900
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:50.020 --> 44:56.660
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:57.140 --> 45:06.860
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
